# Accepted vulnerabilities (Trivy) – only after checking that they cannot be exploited in SAMAUDIT.
# Format, one per line:   <ID> exp:<YYYY-MM-DD>  # <reason (at least 10 characters)>
#   e.g. CVE-2026-12345 exp:2027-01-31  # affects only the XYZ parser, which SAMAUDIT never calls
